    313           *  @param[in,out]  omega_startup  = estimated motor electrical speed (d and q equations)
    314           *  @param[in]      vq_alignment   = measured voltage during alignment phase (equal to \f$ R_s I_q \f$ )
    315           *  @param[in]      params = this structure contains parameters used for startup observer K1, K2
    316           *  @return         error  = \f$ \hat{\omega_{d}} - \hat{\omega_{q}} \f$
    317           */

